<title>USA: EDITEK gets pre-market clearance for test.</title>
<headline>EDITEK gets pre-market clearance for test.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, N.C. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>EDITEK Inc said Thursday it has received U.S. Food and Drug Administration pre-market clearance for the company's one-step VERDICT THC (marijuana) and its VERDICT Barbiturates test.</p>
<p>The company said it had previously received FDA pre-market clearance for its one-step VERDICT Cocaine and one-step VERDICT Opiates tests.</p>
<p>The VERDICT family of substance abuse tests utilizes the company's patented immunochromatographic technology, the company said.</p>
</text>
